	(text "2 Cell Li-po Battery\nWith thermistor taped on it (Kapton tape)\n!WELD! two 18650 single cell batteries \n(with least 3000mAh to 3500mAh capacity each)\nand add the mid point cable between the two"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 229.362 112.776 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
				(color 238 0 0 1)
